18. REPOSITORY VALIDATION SNAPSHOT (10 OCTOBER 2026) / 18. TAKAITACCEN BINCIKEN REPOSITORY (10 OKTOBA 2026)

EN: Validated against the current default-branch files inspected in MuhmdBuharisaeed/albukhr-admin: admin-external-projects.html, js/admin-external-projects.js, admin-external-due-diligence.html, admin-external-risk-assesment.html, and admin-external-funding.html. This is a read-only source review, not a live production test.

HA: An kwatanta SOP da fayilolin default branch da aka duba a MuhmdBuharisaeed/albukhr-admin: admin-external-projects.html, js/admin-external-projects.js, admin-external-due-diligence.html, admin-external-risk-assesment.html da admin-external-funding.html. Binciken source ne na karatu kawai; ba gwajin live production ba ne.

EN: Application review: the UI exposes Start Review for submitted applications; Approve, Request Revision and Reject for under_review applications; and Convert to Project for approved applications. Converted records are described by the UI as External Project drafts, with activation remaining a separate server-side gate.

HA: Application review: UI yana nuna Start Review ga submitted; Approve, Request Revision da Reject ga under_review; sannan Convert to Project ga approved. UI ya bayyana converted record a matsayin draft na External Project, kuma activation yana nan a matsayin gate na server dabam.

EN: Due diligence: the inspected page starts a case only when the application is under_review; it records check states and evidence references and explicitly states that completion does not activate the project. Risk assessment: the page states that a completed READY due-diligence case is a prerequisite; risk completion is readiness only.

HA: Due diligence: shafin da aka duba yana fara case ne idan application tana under_review; yana rubuta states na checks da references na shaida, kuma ya bayyana cewa kammalawa ba ta kunna project. Risk assessment: shafin ya ce dole due diligence ya kammala da READY kafin a fara; kammala risk readiness ne kawai.

EN: Funding: the inspected page runs a server assessment before recording a funding decision. Its own boundary note says that approved capital requirement is not verified liquidity, custody/escrow approval, staking-term approval or activation.

HA: Funding: shafin da aka duba yana gudanar da server assessment kafin rubuta hukuncin funding. Bayanin iyaka a shafin ya ce amincewar capital requirement ba tabbatar da liquidity ba ce, ba amincewar custody/escrow ba ce, ba amincewar staking terms ba ce, kuma ba activation ba ce.

EN: AAL2/MFA wording: Application Review explicitly calls ensureMfa() and redirects to the MFA page when required by the admin configuration. The inspected Due Diligence, Risk and Funding page code calls requireAdmin() and displays “AAL2 VERIFIED” but does not show the same explicit ensureMfa() call. This observation alone does not prove a server-side bypass; server/RPC enforcement and deployed configuration remain to be verified by the security owner. Administrators must follow the actual enforced MFA challenge and must not treat a UI badge alone as proof.

HA: Bayanin AAL2/MFA: Application Review yana kiran ensureMfa() a sarari kuma yana tura admin zuwa shafin MFA idan settings sun wajabta. Code na Due Diligence, Risk da Funding da aka duba yana kiran requireAdmin() kuma yana nuna “AAL2 VERIFIED”, amma ba a ga ensureMfa() iri ɗaya ba. Wannan lura kaɗai ba ta tabbatar da cewa akwai bypass a server ba; mai security dole ne ya tabbatar da server/RPC enforcement da deployed configuration. Admin ya bi ainihin MFA challenge da tsarin ke tilastawa, kuma kada ya ɗauki badge a UI shi kaɗai a matsayin hujja.

EN: Outstanding implementation verification: confirm the authoritative operational path and backend gates for custody/escrow where applicable, terms, disclosure, funding readiness, technical readiness and final activation; and confirm server-side AAL2 enforcement for every relevant RPC. These are technical implementation checks and must not be reported as complete until the responsible owner verifies them. The ALBUKHR Team has approved this document as an internal SOP limited to External Projects Admin use.

HA: Abubuwan tabbatar da implementation da suka rage: tabbatar da ainihin hanyar aiki da backend gates na custody/escrow inda ya dace, terms, disclosure, funding readiness, technical readiness da final activation; sannan a tabbatar da server-side AAL2 enforcement ga kowane RPC da ya dace. Waɗannan checks ne na technical implementation; kada a ce an kammala su sai mai alhaki ya tabbatar. ALBUKHR Team ta amince da wannan takarda a matsayin SOP na cikin gida, wanda ya takaita ga Admin na External Projects.

Validation outcome / Sakamakon bincike

EN: The documented separation between application approval, conversion, due-diligence readiness, risk readiness, funding decision and activation is consistent with the inspected UI. ALBUKHR Team approval is recorded for internal SOP use only. The custody/terms/disclosure/activation paths and consistent MFA/AAL2 enforcement remain implementation-verification items; this SOP must not be read as proof that those controls have already been deployed or tested.

HA: Bambancin application approval, conversion, due-diligence readiness, risk readiness, funding decision da activation ya dace da UI da aka duba. An rubuta amincewar ALBUKHR Team don amfani da SOP a cikin gida kawai. Hanyoyin custody/terms/disclosure/activation da daidaitaccen MFA/AAL2 enforcement har yanzu abubuwan tabbatar da implementation ne; wannan SOP ba hujja ba ce cewa an riga an fitar da ko an gwada waɗannan controls.


